WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.175
The Magic Handoff Proxy Mechanism.

00:00:03.125 --> 00:00:12.937
TENET5 analysis reveals a structural anomaly correlating CFNIS oversight failures with the untouchable status of high-vector lobbying networks.

00:00:12.937 --> 00:00:22.250
When politically sensitive targets face friction, the CFNIS absorbs investigative liability into an opaque military oversight structure.

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:24.475
Evidence trails stall.

00:00:24.475 --> 00:00:27.212
Complainants face retaliation.

00:00:27.212 --> 00:00:30.137
Institutional memory is purged.
